cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "VREmotionDetection"
type: software
version: 3.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-17
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/vcu-swim-lab/VREmotionDetection"
url: "https://github.com/vcu-swim-lab/VREmotionDetection"
abstract: >-
  A Unity package that predicts seven emotions (anger, disgust, fear, happiness, neutral, sadness,
  surprise) from Meta Quest Pro face tracking. It runs an on-device local model or Typesafe's
  Jev model, with optional per-player calibration.
keywords:
  - emotion recognition
  - facial expression
  - face tracking
  - virtual reality
  - Meta Quest Pro
  - Unity
